jMyMzIx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/32321?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire","html_url":"https://github.com/fire","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-01-17T20:12:29Z","updated_at":"2025-01-17T20:12:29Z","body":"@lyuma Can you look at this? This isn't very clear.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2599117038/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2599209916","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/101543#issuecomment-2599209916","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/101543","id":2599209916,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6a7Mu8","user":{"login":"kistz","id":93079615,"node_id":"U_kgDOBYxIPw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/93079615?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kistz","html_url":"https://github.com/kistz","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kistz/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kistz/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kistz/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kistz/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kistz/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kistz/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kistz/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kistz/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kistz/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-01-17T21:04:04Z","updated_at":"2025-01-17T21:13:18Z","body":"Hey fire thanks for responding :)\r\nWithout my addition it works as expected - the ResourceLoader get registered at_front.\r\nThe problem lies in the way the editor processess this information.\r\n# Without my addition\r\nNote that in the filters it gets processed correctly. But the preinserted default name is still .tres and if only typing the filter gets ignored.\r\n![image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/6e1b337f-06d8-4282-9d5a-45638a54ccd6)\r\n\r\n# With my addition\r\nThe default extension also gets set correctly\r\n![image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/d1bf77c7-e7da-4248-bd1e-e11da739ceb9)\r\n\r\nThis happens because of the prefered List local variable introduced in the function showed under 2. Minimal fix in my original comment :) \r\n\r\nThis merely stop the editor from forcing .tres to the front again - hence i labeled it as a bug ^^\r\n\r\n(I also just realized that my original comment was not explicit enough about what the problem actually is - mb)\r\n","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2599209916/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2614590439","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/101543#issuecomment-2614590439","issue_url":"https://api.gith